      "",
      "Customer names and Walmart order identifiers are deliberately excluded:",
      "this file is committed to a repository with a remote. order_ref is a",
      "stable hash and source_row points back to the workbook.",
      "",
      "Estimated fees are recorded at 4dp because that is their stored precision",
      "under profit-v1. Rounding them to 2dp shifts GR-03 and GR-18 by one cent."
    ],
